<% content_for :title, 'Talk to Ora' %><section class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A HUMAN, WHEN YOU NEED ONE</span><h1>Let’s <em>talk.</em></h1><p>A question, a concern, or just a place to begin. We’re here.</p></section><section class="section narrow"><div class="form-card"><%= render 'shared/errors', object: @support %><%= form_with model: @support, url: support_path do |f| %><%= f.label :email, 'Your email' %><%= f.email_field :email, required: true %><%= f.label :message, 'What’s on your mind?' %><%= f.text_area :message, rows: 6, required: true, maxlength: 3000, placeholder: 'Tell us how we can help. Please avoid sharing medical records or identity numbers here.' %><%= f.submit 'Send to the Ora team →', class: 'button primary full' %><% end %><p class="fine-print">This form creates a private request in Ora operations. Ora is for planned care and is not an emergency service.</p></div></section>
